<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for e-Hub by CareSynq, a business management platform providing CRM, analytics, and operational monitoring services.">
    <title>Privacy Policy - e-Hub by CareSynq</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #000000;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #000000;
            padding: 40px;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            padding-bottom: 30px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000000;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .header .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .header .date {
            font-size: 0.95em;
        }

        .divider {
            border-top: 1px solid #000000;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }

        .intro {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .section h2 {
            font-size: 1.3em;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .section h3 {
            font-size: 1.1em;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 20px 0 10px 0;
        }

        .section p {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .section ul {
            margin: 15px 0 15px 40px;
            list-style-type: disc;
        }

        .section li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .notice {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 15px;
            border: 1px solid #000000;
        }

        .notice strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .contact {
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 2px solid #000000;
        }

        .contact h2 {
            font-size: 1.3em;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .contact p {
            margin: 8px 0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container {
                padding: 20px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 1.5em;
            }

            .section ul {
                margin-left: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

    <div class="header">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">e-Hub by CareSynq</div>
        <div class="date">Last updated: 10 January 2026</div>
    </div>

    <div class="intro">
        <p>CareSynq ("we", "our", or "us") operates the e-Hub mobile and web application ("the App"), a centralized platform providing CRM, operational monitoring, business analytics, and quality control services for commercial enterprises and organizations.</p>
        <p>This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and protect information when you and your organization access or use e-Hub.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>e-Hub collects only the information necessary to deliver a secure, functional, and optimized business management platform.</p>

        <h3>a. Account & User Information</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Full name</li>
            <li>Email address</li>
            <li>Phone number (if provided)</li>
            <li>User role, department, and access permissions</li>
            <li>Organization / company name</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <h3>b. Business & Operational Data</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>CRM records, customer contact details, and business interactions</li>
            <li>Internal communication logs and inquiry handling data</li>
            <li>Performance metrics and operational analytics</li>
            <li>Workflow configurations, pipelines, and operational logs</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="notice">
            <strong>Data Ownership Notice</strong>
            <p>e-Hub operates as a data processor. All business and operational data uploaded to the platform remains the exclusive property of the client organization.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <h3>c. Device & Technical Data</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>Device type, model, and operating system</li>
            <li>App version and usage logs (including crash reports)</li>
            <li>IP address used for security and fraud prevention</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Operate and maintain the e-Hub platform</li>
            <li>Enable CRM workflows and operational monitoring</li>
            <li>Generate reports and business analytics</li>
            <li>Provide technical support</li>
            <li>Ensure platform security and access control</li>
            <li>Send essential service notifications</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell personal or business data, and we do not use data for advertising purposes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>3. Data Sharing & Disclosure</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Within your organization based on assigned permissions</li>
            <li>With trusted service providers under confidentiality obligations</li>
            <li>When required by law or legal process</li>
            <li>To protect the rights and security of CareSynq and its users</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>4. Data Storage & Security</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Encrypted and secure server environments</li>
            <li>Role-based access control</li>
            <li>Continuous monitoring and security reviews</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Active Accounts: Data is retained while the organization's account remains active</li>
            <li>Account Termination: Data is archived or deleted according to contractual agreements</li>
            <li>Backups: Limited residual data may remain in secure backups for disaster recovery</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>6. User Rights</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Access personal data</li>
            <li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
            <li>Request account deletion through authorized administrators</li>
            <li>Restrict certain processing activities where applicable</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>7. International Data Transfers</h2>
        <p>Your data may be processed or stored on servers outside your country. Appropriate safeguards are applied to protect your information.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>e-Hub is intended for business use and is not designed for individuals under the age of 18.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>9. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>The App may integrate with third-party services governed by their own privacy policies.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Continued use of the App constitutes acceptance of any updates.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>11. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>This Privacy Policy is governed by the laws of the Arab Republic of Egypt.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="contact">
        <h2>12. Contact Us</h2>
        <p><strong>CareSynq</strong></p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@caresynq.net">info@caresynq.net</a></p>
        <p>Website: <a href="https://www.caresynq.net" target="_blank">www.caresynq.net</a></p>
    </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
